<h3>Slipstream Theme & Layout (v0.1.0 for TiddlyWiki v5.4.0+)</h3>
<p>A modern, generic 3-column desktop reading workspace and mobile <code>zoomin</code> single-tiddler layout with native UI primitives.</p>
<ul>
	<li><strong>Activate Layout:</strong> Press <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+L</kbd> (or go to <em>Control Panel → Appearance → Layout</em>) and select <strong>Slipstream</strong>.</li>
	<li><strong>Documentation & Reference:</strong> View the complete [[Slipstream Knowledge Base|$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs]] for UI primitive snippets, layout guides, and customization tips.</li>
	<li><strong>Pin Any Tiddler to Left Nav:</strong> Tag any tiddler with <code>$:/tags/Pinned</code> (or customize <code>$:/config/slipstream/pinned-filter</code> in Settings).</li>
	<li><strong>Customize Mobile Bottom Bar:</strong> Tag any tiddler with <code>$:/tags/Slipstream/BottomBar</code> or list titles in <code>$:/config/slipstream/mobile-shortcuts</code>.</li>
	<li><strong>Wide Mode for Dashboards:</strong> Add field <code>page-width: wide</code> (or tag <code>Wide</code>) to any tiddler to expand it from <code>840px</code> to <code>1120px</code>.</li>
</ul>
